From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:43:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: clpc: drop the T8142 expectation from the ANE
 KUnit test

The ANE floor change checks that every SoC table leaves the ANE DCS
floor at 0, including apple_clpc_hw_t8142. No T8142 table exists in this
tree, so with KUnit built in, clpc.c does not compile ("use of
undeclared identifier"). Builds without built-in KUnit are not affected.
Keep the T6040 and T8132 checks.

Fixes: bc4687bec595 ("soc: apple: clpc: raise DRAM and fabric floors for ANE work")
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c b/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
index 56a9cacc2e..349aa26865 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/clpc.c
@@ -1411,7 +1411,6 @@ static void apple_clpc_ane_no_provider_test(struct kunit *test)
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_EQ(test, demand[APPLE_CLPC_SOC], 0u);
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_EQ(test, apple_clpc_hw_t6040.ane[APPLE_CLPC_DCS], 0);
 	KUNIT_EXPECT_EQ(test, apple_clpc_hw_t8132.ane[APPLE_CLPC_DCS], 0);
-	KUNIT_EXPECT_EQ(test, apple_clpc_hw_t8142.ane[APPLE_CLPC_DCS], 0);
 }
 
 static void apple_clpc_ane_wake_removal_test(struct kunit *test)
